profile: tinyrustlm.context.v1
updated_utc: 2026-06-29T22:59:10Z
context_summary: TinyRustLM is the entire focus of this site. It is not a generic MiRust, WordPress, or GGUF-only project page.
project_context:
  - Custom Rust/WASM browser-local SLM runtime.
  - Custom .slm artifact format and strict validation.
  - q8_0 and q4_0 quantized execution under a 33.5 MB model budget.
  - ADP1, ASP1, and ALR1 adapter sidecars with Rust validation-before-apply.
  - Selector registries, module-plan receipts, deterministic smoke tests, and local-only diagnostics.
site_context:
  - Plain PHP route shell with static docs.
  - Native HTML/CSS/vanilla JS only.
  - Contact route remains /contact/ with footer link text Contact Mike Kappel.
